{"type":"standard","title":"Heterogram (literature)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Heterogram (literature)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q3145104","titles":{"canonical":"Heterogram_(literature)","normalized":"Heterogram (literature)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Heterogram (literature)</span></span>"},"pageid":7731054,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1358045453","tid":"31cc55dc-616d-11f1-8106-d4b138525ce1","timestamp":"2026-06-06T06:01:44Z","description":"Word, phrase or sentence with no repeated letter","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heterogram_(literature)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heterogram_(literature)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heterogram_(literature)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Heterogram_(literature)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heterogram_(literature)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Heterogram_(literature)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heterogram_(literature)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Heterogram_(literature)"}},"extract":"A heterogram is a word, phrase, or sentence in which no letter of the alphabet occurs more than once. The terms isogram and nonpattern word have also been used to mean the same thing.","extract_html":"<p>A <b>heterogram</b> is a word, phrase, or sentence in which no letter of the alphabet occurs more than once. The terms <b>isogram</b> and <b>nonpattern word</b> have also been used to mean the same thing.</p>"}